id: pm-review-finding-lineage
title: Keep one disposition across provider finding observations
description: "Preserve review-specific finding identity across providers and revisions, with explicit confirmation, retained observations and one canonical disposition. Core duplicate detection and pm-jev remain candidate proposers."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-22T19:22:39.664Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-23T08:57:51.480Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-23T08:57:51.474Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-22T20:59:44.000Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Near matches remain proposals until confirmed; Source withdrawal does not erase prior reasoning; Duplicate imports add no second disposition; Typed SDK and CLI provide compact TOON and JSON with actionable typed refusals; Works without git and validates a read-only public tracker copy
parent: pm-review-epic
resolution: "Delivered by https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/29 (merge 22fdfd58e5f3, head 4312cfc43fd5)"
expected_result: Near matches remain proposals until confirmed; Source withdrawal does not erase prior reasoning; Duplicate imports add no second disposition; Typed SDK and CLI provide compact TOON and JSON with actionable typed refusals; Works without git and validates a read-only public tracker copy
actual_result: "Merged at 2026-10-22T20:59:44Z; no readable required checks, so every completed head check run had to succeed, be neutral or be skipped; successful checks: CodeQL, CodeRabbit, codeql, cubic · AI code reviewer, test (22), test (26)"
comments[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-22T19:23:23.079Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against installed core SDK 2026.10.18 and current CLI registry 2026.10.22, pm-jev dedupe.ts and index.ts, and pm-review import/verdict/coverage/round code. Core duplicates and scoreItemSimilarity rank lexical candidates; pm-jev dedupe proposes or explicitly links duplicate/related work. Neither preserves review-specific cross-provider observations and a canonical review disposition. Reuse complete SDK reads, similarity scoring, lock-scoped idempotent comments and the existing item mutation/history pipeline. Preserve original imported decisions as historical observations; compute one canonical disposition for confirmed groups. Local checks are targeted; CI npm and Bun release gates provide the complete evidence."
  "2026-10-22T19:32:32.670Z",codex-agent,"Public real-data validation completed read-only against an origin/main tracker export in a plain directory with git discovery fenced off: 48 total items, 22 review observations, 3 providers, 2 known source revisions, 22 independent canonical dispositions, 4 core candidate clusters, 3 review pair proposals checked and all 3 left unconfirmed. All 102 original durable files remained byte-identical. Largest compact JSON lineage receipt: 894 bytes. Details and repeatable validator: docs/finding-lineage-validation.md and test/lineage-public-tracker.ts."
  "2026-10-22T19:40:24.186Z",codex-agent,"Correction to the initial overlap note: this branch pins and installs PM SDK 2026.10.19; the canonical checkout inspected first had 2026.10.18. The registry CLI version was verified as 2026.10.22. The checked SDK capabilities and overlap conclusions are unchanged. Three isolated behavioral reverts all exit 1 with named assertion failures: confirmation disabled breaks canonical identity; withdrawal marking disabled breaks the withdrawn flag; canonical verdict routing reverted breaks shared fix/commit projection. The original package source is unchanged by these scratch-copy reverts. Local strict health reports a global pm-github version-skew finding and one pre-existing stale item advisory; CI uses a fresh runner to verify the tracked project. A local directory package-install fixture hit the SDK 10000-entry scan refusal; the fixture now installs only release contents. No upstream issues were filed."
  "2026-10-22T19:50:18.106Z",codex-agent,"Implementation and public validation are complete. PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/pull/29 (ready for review). Live CLI 2026.10.22 duplicates help also confirms core cluster discovery; sibling pm-jev supplies candidates without review-specific identity. PM-linked local checks passed 3/3: node --test test/lineage.test.ts (6/6), npm run typecheck, npm run lint. The final import-receipt refinement also passed its targeted repeat-import/withdrawal test; receipts now expose canonical ids, effective verdicts and newly withdrawn counts. A fourth isolated behavioral revert of receipt projection fails the canonical-id assertion. First full CI at commit 5e85ead passed Node 22 npm, Node 26 npm and Bun: 182/182 tests and 1/1 packed acceptance per gate, 29 measured source files at 100/100/100/100, zero duplication. Run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-review/actions/runs/39842585284 . The PR retains the final-head gate receipt for the receipt refinement. Automatic reviewer availability is incomplete (CodeRabbit automatic review disabled; Sourcery budget unavailable); no approval is claimed. Proposal hashes bind snapshots rather than reserving both items. No merge or release performed; item remains in progress for orchestrator verification."
  "2026-10-22T20:17:23.076Z",codex-agent,"Reclaimed for orchestrator review follow-up on PR 29. Address all five findings: isolate and report malformed/dangling confirmation records across consumers; detect disposition conflicts regardless of origin and select canonical by decision time; make verdict routing and audit mutation atomic with clean missing-item refusal; require complete import evidence before withdrawal; include titles and comments in proposal revisions. Each fix gets an independent behavioral revert proof. Preserve append-only history and use full npm/Bun release gates for the final source."
  "2026-10-22T20:42:05.886Z",codex-agent,"All five orchestrator findings are implemented. Invalid and dangling confirmation records become attributable issues rather than exceptions in review consumers. Independent roots must agree regardless of verdict origin; canonical ownership follows decision timestamps, later decisions and retained disagreements remain visible after replay/reverse links, and changed imported decisions advance their time without relabeling import provenance. Verdict evidence and fields use one atomic SDK update on the stable observation, with typed missing-item remedies. SDK withdrawal is off by default and requires snapshotComplete=true plus exact unfiltered snapshot coverage; the trusted GitHub command supplies that assertion. Proposal hashes include titles and full comments. Targeted lineage suites passed 13/13 before the added import-time/missing-target cases; targeted lineage modules measured 100/100/100/100, 30 source files have full docstrings, and duplication remains zero. Final targeted checks, behavioral reverts and full CI release gates follow."
  "2026-10-22T20:48:09.254Z",codex-agent,"Review follow-up verification complete. All nine isolated behavioral reverts failed the intended regression (only the named behavior changed in a scratch source copy; real SDK trackers, no SDK mocks): bad_records: node --test --test-name-pattern='bad and dangling confirmations' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; import_conflict: node --test --test-name-pattern='import-derived dispositions' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; decision_time: node --test --test-name-pattern='decision time owns canonical' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; atomic_write: node --test --test-name-pattern='verdict audit and fields commit atomically' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; missing_target: node --test --test-name-pattern='missing observation verdict targets' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; withdrawal_coverage: node --test --test-name-pattern='filtered and one-provider imports' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; title_revision: node --test --test-name-pattern='proposal revisions bind' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; comment_revision: node --test --test-name-pattern='proposal revisions bind' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1; import_decision_time: node --test --test-name-pattern='changed import decisions advance' test/lineage-followup.test.ts => exit 1. Reverts respectively restore throw-on-bad-record, local-only conflict filtering, lexical canonical ownership, split/routed verdict writes, untyped missing-target handling, absence-only withdrawal, omitted title hash, omitted comment hash, and stale import decision timestamps. Correct source passes PM-linked checks 4/4: node --test test/lineage.test.ts (6/6), node --test test/lineage-followup.test.ts (9/9), npm run typecheck, npm run lint. Strengthened timestamp assertions also pass the focused unchanged test (1/1) and fail its revert. npm run duplication passes 0/7249 duplicated lines across 48 sources; npm run docstring passes 103 declarations across 30 files. No thresholds changed. Final pushed-head npm/Bun CI release evidence will be recorded on PR 29. Claim released for orchestrator verification; item remains in_progress."
